      "value": "One cause of this that affected the master was fixed earlier this year and then another cause related to teleporting very quickly was fixed in the last update. \nMarking this as complete for now because those are the only known causes of being unjustly kicked for \"unusual client behavior\"\nThis message will still exist to catch modded clients, so if it ever re-appears to unmodded clients please make a new canny.",
